    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secret game for your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy over 100 themed tables, over 50 daily special events and real-time challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the records at all the tables and earn your crowns, badges and increase your prestige. Configure it to play the way you want, even in full screen. Improve yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hidden Pinbal is here, with daily challenges, special events and all progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as you like, small, full screen, with or without sound. All customizable in the info menu, for a quick start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your favourite table among more than 100 different themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily or timeless challenges to rank up. Special Events Dialy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete assignments, stars, multipliers and tasks for more XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve yourself at every table and get the crown at one billion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Prestige, increase your reputation and get new badges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide the game or remove it with a single button, Paused in the taskbar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick and easy game, beat your records. And enjoy the events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
